There are several ways you can implement this method.  This is one way to do it.



Check for Invalid Value:

The method should start by checking if the given number is less than 1. If it is, print "Invalid Value" and return.

Loop through Factors:

Use a for loop to iterate through numbers from 1 to number.

Inside the loop, check if number is divisible evenly by the current value of i.

You can do this using the modulus operator (%).

Print Factors:

If the remainder of number % i is 0, it means that i is a factor of number.

Print the value of i on a new line.